sequenceDiagram
    actor utilisateur as Utilisateur
    participant panel as Home Panel
    participant api as Adaptateur API
    participant access as Identity Access
    participant control as Home Control Application
    participant registry as Registre Capacites
    participant ha as Adaptateur Home Assistant
    participant homeAssistant as Home Assistant

    utilisateur->>panel: Demande allumer salon
    panel->>api: Commande avec session et cle idempotence
    api->>access: Authentifier et charger le contexte
    access-->>api: ActorContext
    api->>control: Executer commande
    control->>control: Verifier autorisation et regles metier
    control->>registry: Resoudre capacite et adaptateur
    registry-->>control: Capacite compatible
    control->>ha: Envoyer commande normalisee
    ha->>homeAssistant: Appeler service appareil
    homeAssistant-->>ha: Etat confirme ou erreur
    ha-->>control: Resultat normalise
    control-->>api: CommandResult
    api-->>panel: Etat execute refuse ou echoue
    panel-->>utilisateur: Retour visible et explicite
